            "system_message": "{\n    \"TASK CONTEXT\": \"{\"definition\": [\"For each of the following items, try to form a vivid mental image of the described scene or object.\", \"After attempting to visualize each item, rate the vividness of your mental image on a scale from 1 to 5:\", \"  1 = No image at all; you only 'know' that you are thinking of the object.\", \"  2 = Vague and dim.\", \"  3 = Moderately clear and vivid.\", \"  4 = Clear and reasonably vivid.\", \"  5 = Perfectly clear and as vivid as normal vision.\", \"Rate each item honestly based on the actual vividness of the image, not how vivid you think it should be.\"]}\"\n}",
